# Flavors of Our Lives (adoulin 46), the Harvesting Point with no HELM wait (ENABLE_HELM_WAIT off, the default): a
# level 99 Warrior in the Yahse Hunting Grounds beside the first Harvesting Point with a Sickle, the quest accepted at
# Prog 3 (GMs). The Sickle traded: xi.helm.onTrade reaches pickItem, which finds no Yahse entry in
# xi.helm.dataTable[HARVESTING].zone and, since user ruling 2026-11-05 (kept bugs), finds nothing (the tool kept): the
# handler goes on to its Blightberry action (KEYITEM_OBTAINED). The Lua indexed the nil entry and raised (its baseline
# holds the trade as expect-error). Back in Western Adoulin: Berghent 87, finished: completed (300 bayld, 500 exp,
# Potation Pathfinder).
lists YahseHuntingGrounds/Harvesting_Point/onTrade WesternAdoulin/Berghent/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/87
char zone=YahseHuntingGrounds pos=164.33,0,-283.7 job=WAR lvl=99
quest Adoulin.FlavorsOfOurLives accepted
charvar Quest[9][46]Prog 3
item Sickle
login
trade Harvesting_Point Sickle x1        # Prog 3: nothing found; the Blightberry
warp 97.221,-0.148,-28.68 WesternAdoulin
trigger Berghent                        # Prog 3 with the Blightberry: 87
finish                                  # completed
